                                                "sense_id": "ea623e71-6e51-35b4-80aa-3fee33e70842",
                                                "text": "And now a maiden […] ſupplied them, next, / With a reſplendent table, which the chaſte / Directreſs of the ſtores furniſh'd with bread / And dainties, remnants of the laſt regale."
